    "zero changed RECOMMENDATIONS on this corpus (both eligible tasks agree) \u2014 the null holds. Mechanism differs from the spec's finding-2 prediction: raw cost-key coverage is 100%, but OPERATIONAL cost coverage (cost_captured: positive finite only, 0.0 = no billable work) is <100% for some models, so per-model avg_cost DID diverge between the formulas (see per_model_stat_divergence) \u2014 it simply did not flip any decision because the diverging models were not on the decision boundary",
